21:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Application form: return it to the university",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Application form: return it to the university"}],[["$","p","HEC’s application instructions direct applicants to obtain the form from the FAO or the linked download and return it with supporting evidence to the same university office. HEC does not accept the application directly, and payments operate through participating institutions. Save a receipt or acknowledgement rather than assuming that downloading the form created an application.",{"children":"HEC’s application instructions direct applicants to obtain the form from the FAO or the linked download and return it with supporting evidence to the same university office. HEC does not accept the application directly, and payments operate through participating institutions. Save a receipt or acknowledgement rather than assuming that downloading the form created an application."}],["$","p","Ask for the exact scheme title when a university advertises several kinds of aid. A university’s own fee concession, an external donor award and HEC NBS can have different forms and restrictions. Write the name of the scheme at the top of your personal tracker so evidence from one process is not accidentally submitted to another.",{"children":"Ask for the exact scheme title when a university advertises several kinds of aid. A university’s own fee concession, an external donor award and HEC NBS can have different forms and restrictions. Write the name of the scheme at the top of your personal tracker so evidence from one process is not accidentally submitted to another."}]],["$","ol",null,{"className":"process-steps","aria-label":"Application form: return it to the university","children":[["$","li","Confirm scheme, programme and current window with the FAO",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":1}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Confirm scheme, programme and current window with the FAO"}]]}],["$","li","Obtain the current form and local attachment list",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":2}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Obtain the current form and local attachment list"}]]}],["$","li","Complete a consistent household evidence record",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":3}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Complete a consistent household evidence record"}]]}],["$","li","Submit to the university using its stated method",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":4}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Submit to the university using its stated method"}]]}],["$","li","Retain acknowledgement and follow assessment instructions",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":5}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Retain acknowledgement and follow assessment instructions"}]]}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.hec.gov.pk/english/scholarshipsgrants/NBS/Pages/How-To-Apply.aspx",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.hec.gov.pk/english/scholarshipsgrants/NBS/Pages/How-To-Apply.aspx","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"HEC NBS how to apply"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Explain the household picture with consistent evidence",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Explain the household picture with consistent evidence"}],[["$","p","HEC’s FAQ gives salary slips, utility bills and parent/guardian CNIC among supporting documents; your institution can specify the full pack. It also states that the university announces start/end dates, that existing assistance can affect eligibility, and that funding is not retrospective to enrolment. Confirm your own situation with the FAO.",{"children":"HEC’s FAQ gives salary slips, utility bills and parent/guardian CNIC among supporting documents; your institution can specify the full pack. It also states that the university announces start/end dates, that existing assistance can affect eligibility, and that funding is not retrospective to enrolment. Confirm your own situation with the FAO."}],"$L24"],"$undefined","$L25","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L26","$L27"]}],"$L28","$L29"]}]
