24:["$","p","Use the same time period for income and expenditure. Separate recurring costs from one-off bills and explain irregular earnings without turning an estimate into a salary certificate. If an income entry differs from a document, add a factual explanation and ask which evidence the office accepts. Never change a document or omit a source of income to make the application look stronger.",{"children":"Use the same time period for income and expenditure. Separate recurring costs from one-off bills and explain irregular earnings without turning an estimate into a salary certificate. If an income entry differs from a document, add a factual explanation and ask which evidence the office accepts. Never change a document or omit a source of income to make the application look stronger."}]
